WEBVTT

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.540
Masaru's New Power

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.540
Evolve, RiseGreymon!

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.900
Masaru's New Power!

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.540
Evolve, RiseGreymon!

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:18.800
When a Digiegg was swept away from the Digital World to the human world, Falcomon appeared to take it back.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:24.520
Born from that egg, Piyomon swore to protect Chika and opposed Falcomon.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:31.190
Just then, with a flash of lightning, a mysterious Digimon appeared!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.320
An Ultimate Level...

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.360
You won't be able to overpower this one.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.480
Retreat!

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.550
You think the top street fighter, Daimon Masaru-sama, is gonna back down from this?

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.620
Stop, Masaru!

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:53.130
Damn it!

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.040
Masaru-niichan!

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:57.720
Mega Burst!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:01.390
What?

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:20.180
Look out, Master!

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:26.870
Lalamon!

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.270
You foolish humans.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:34.070
I, Mercurimon, will cast down on you the iron hammer of judgment.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:37.000
Don't get full of yourself!

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:40.340
C'mon Agumon, wake up!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:49.930
Chika.

00:01:50.390 --> 00:01:51.240
Piyomon?

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.500
I will protect you.

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:56.230
Goodbye, Chika.

00:01:58.530 --> 00:01:59.490
Piyomon!

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:03.410
Go back to the Digital World!

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.820
CHIKA!

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:13.890
How reckless...

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:14.500
What about Masaru and the others?

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.130
I'm getting no response!

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:18.450
Restoring the monitor.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:20.810
He's unharmed!

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:26.000
He flung away his life to protect a human.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.220
What a fool.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.910
Piyomon!

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:29.880
Give him back!

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.220
Give me back my Piyomon!

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.020
Chika, get out of here!

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.420
We're going home, Falcomon.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:41.770
O-Okay.

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.590
Piyomon!

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:47.800
Piyomon!!

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.730
Oww...

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.790
Bear with it a little.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.350
That bastard...

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:03.990
I'm gonna get him back ten billion times more for this!

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:06.990
Sounds like the weak threats of a sore loser to me.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.080
What?!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.950
You in particular felt the difference in power first-hand, didn't you?

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.290
Stop arguing.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.230
Not at a time like this.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:19.630
Tohma is right, Masaru.

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:22.990
We can't win against Mercurimon in our current state.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.120
We won't know that unless we try!

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.840
He is an Ultimate Level.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.720
Ultimate Level?

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:32.520
In other words, a Digimon whose power is closest to God's.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:36.600
Just who is this Mercurimon?

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:43.490
Long ago, he was a forest king who governed over the Great Zaganda Forest that spread out in the eastern region of the Digital World.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:47.200
Why did someone like him appear in the human world?

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:51.700
His goal may be to destroy our world.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:52.910
What?

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:54.970
Maybe...

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:59.580
the reason why the boundary between the human and Digital World is becoming instable is also because...

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.380
It was all Mercurimon's doing?!

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.130
It's possible.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:07.170
Then all the more reason!

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:09.390
Let's go now to beat up Mercurimon and...

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.100
Stop!

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:11.520
Chika!

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.380
Why do humans and Digimon have to fight each other?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:21.510
The time I spent with Piyomon was really short,

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:24.300
but we were able to become friends!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:29.160
There's got to be some way humans and Digimon can live peacefully together!

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:35.880
Come now, Chika.

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:37.230
Let's go home.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.170
Satsuma-san!

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:45.030
Look at the mess you've gotten us into!

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:48.100
Governor Hashiba.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:49.540
Governor?

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:53.010
He's a dignitary from the National Government's Ministry of Confidentiality.

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:59.260
I believe it is the duty of DATS to keep these Digimon incidents under wraps,

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.280
but what am I seeing now?!

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:05.110
At this rate, you won't be able to fool the citizens anymore!

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.070
Hold on just a minute, old man!

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.150
I don't care if you're a governor or whatever,

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:11.780
don't butt in when you don't even know what's going on!

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:13.490
Who are you?

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:15.540
I'm his mother.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.350
Please excuse my son's rudeness.

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.860
Don't apologize to a jerk like him, Mom!

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:25.460
Governor.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:28.920
I'll make sure to properly carry out DATS's mission next time.

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:35.940
No, there is no further need for you to do anything anymore.

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.390
I would like DATS to be dissolved at once.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:39.850
Dissolved?!

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.250
Damn it!

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:45.920
Damn it!

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:47.920
Damn it!!

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:50.480
Damn it...!

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:51.780
Aniki...

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:54.740
I know just how you feel, Aniki.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:58.110
He just suddenly came in and said DATS is dissolved!

00:06:58.110 --> 00:06:59.640
That guy pissed me off, too!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.390
It's not that!

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:06.050
That damn Mercurimon... I'm definitely going to make him pay!

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.360
Really...

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.730
Really!

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:25.140
How many times will you cause trouble for Mercurimon-sama before you're satisfied?

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:30.430
Both Ikuto and I found that Digiegg.

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:35.350
I promised with Ikuto that we'll both take good care of it until it hatched!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.340
Good grief.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:41.160
Only troublesome things have occurred ever since Ikuto came here.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.610
Ikuto hasn't done anything wrong!

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:45.450
Don't talk badly about him!

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:48.950
That's Mercurimon's voice!

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:50.490
Hey, wait!

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:54.260
Mercurimon!

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:54.260
Mercurimon-sama!

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:55.510
Don't get any closer.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:01.640
The human's evilness is swirling within the egg.

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:04.060
I can no longer prevent it from hatching.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.490
Chi-ka.

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:15.160
Where are you, Chika?

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.160
I'll always

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.910
be with you...

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:20.340
Oh dear. Oh dear!

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.730
He still has his earlier memories, before he turned back into a Digiegg!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:24.460
Chika.

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:25.660
Chika.

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:33.170
Forget about the human.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:34.680
No...

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:36.650
No...!

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:50.940
Aquilamon

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:50.940
Adult Level

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.310
Aquilamon.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:46.330
An Adult Level that can fly at mach speed.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.370
His special attack is Blast Laser.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.940
He shoots ring-shaped beams from his mouth!

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:52.790
Oh dear! Oh dear!

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.230
He evolved!

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:57.960
Halt.

00:08:57.960 --> 00:08:58.320
But!

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:04.290
His heart has gone to a place where we can no longer take back.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:08.500
How many times will you keep repeating the same mistakes until you're satisfied...

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:11.090
You damn humans...

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:12.830
Hello!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:16.060
Today's weather in Tokyo is as cloudy as ever...

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:19.160
But look at this blue sky!

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.160
What is that?!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.450
What could that be?

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:30.560
It's a huge bird!

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:32.120
Captain!

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:34.570
There's a Digimon signal circling 50km away from a ship in Tokyo!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:35.740
Is it Mercurimon?

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.360
No, sir!

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.740
Analyzing data...

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.160
It's Aquilamon!

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.310
The Digimon signal is heading north!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:46.450
An SOS transmission is being transmitted from the boat in that area!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.210
Secure Aquilamon before it lands!

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:50.670
Roger!

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:50.670
Roger!

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.030
Where is Masaru?!

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.130
Damn it! Damn it!

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:04.560
What is that? A monster?!

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:05.810
Monster?

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:06.810
Aniki!

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:07.890
Yeah!

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:12.910
This large bird is now heading north towards the ship.

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:16.830
It's attacked our ship, it's on fire!

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:23.910
...we do not know.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.790
Furthermore, could the government know something about this bird's identity?

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.720
What is this bird?

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.660
Where could it have come from?

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:38.710
Chika, what's wrong?

00:10:38.710 --> 00:10:39.880
That's Piyomon!

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:43.130
Where are you going, Chika?

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:44.150
Wait!

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:47.150
Wait up, Aniki!

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:51.660
Now that DATS is disbanded, we're not allowed to do anything anymore...

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:52.670
Shut up!

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:57.440
Who else can beat those Digimon besides us?

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:01.200
We've got a duty to do what we have to do!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.200
That's what a man does!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:07.650
But I'm not good at swimming...

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:11.290
Tohma!

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:15.290
I thought it would be too far for you to swim.

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:17.750
That's nice of you!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.040
Master!

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:24.070
Yeah.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.100
Target sighted!

00:11:26.970 --> 00:11:28.620
I have him in my sights, too!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.210
We'll drive him as close as possible to the sea's surface,

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.270
so take care of the rest!

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:33.480
Roger!

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.230
Start the plan!

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:37.950
Sunshine Beam!

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:44.780
Dash Double Claw!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.290
Gaogamon!

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:50.740
Spiral Blow!

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:52.690
Sunshine Beam!

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:55.580
Crap!

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.540
I'll stop him!

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.560
Sunflowmon!

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:02.970
Chika...

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:04.130
Where are you?

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:06.510
Aniki!

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:07.490
Yeah!

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:09.970
I just heard him say "Chika" right now!

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:12.930
Could he be... Piyomon?

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:14.640
What?

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:15.870
Chika...

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.110
Chika...

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.520
What?

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:24.650
That's Piyomon?

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:26.820
It's true.

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:30.850
The Digimon signals of that Aquilamon and Piyomon's match up perfectly.

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:32.600
Hurry up, Tohma!

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:33.540
What are you going to do?

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:35.710
I'll stop him by force!

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:39.170
How do you plan to hit him when he's high up in the sky?

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:41.170
There's nothing you can do!

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:45.870
Piyomon! It's me!

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:47.140
Chika's brother, Masaru!

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:48.780
Chika...

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:50.800
What?

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:53.100
Even though he looks different, he's still Piyomon.

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:55.770
I'm sure he remembers me.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:00.120
Chika...

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.480
Where are you?

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.000
Where am I?

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:18.420
You're awake.

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.020
The old man with the Digivice.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:24.860
That guy saved all of us.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:26.050
Where's Piyomon?

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:37.200
Chika... where are you...?

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.950
I'm... right... here...

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.490
Where are you going?

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.130
Isn't it obvious?

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:52.330
I'm gonna go beat him up and...!

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.840
It's useless.

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:54.830
What?!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.710
You can't win over anyone in your present state.

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:00.390
What?!

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:02.420
I'm the best street fighter there is!

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:06.880
As of now, you wouldn't even be able to defeat me.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:11.370
Since you're said that much, why don't you try beating me first?!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:13.820
Hoi!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:15.010
Hoi!

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:18.600
Aniki!

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.450
What's this mean?!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:22.940
How can someone like me who's good at fighting be...?

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:27.210
Are you still not aware of your own inexperience?

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:28.030
What?!

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:30.360
If not, then go.

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:32.450
Then you'll realize the truth.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.000
Fine!

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.200
I would've gone without you telling me that anyway!

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:39.150
Aniki!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:43.640
The magnitude of all that you're lacking right now...

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:47.630
Until you understand that, you cannot mature to greatness.

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:50.600
I'll do it!

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:53.390
I'll defeat that guy all by myself!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:14:59.890
Aniki!

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:01.900
It really is hopeless, Aniki!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:03.730
What?!

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:06.730
I'm not saying you aren't strong...

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:07.320
But...

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.460
But what?!

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:12.200
You don't think I have a chance at winning either, do you?!

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:14.390
I'll do it!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.560
If I dither around in a place like this, my manliness will rot!

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:21.520
Hey, Piyomon!

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:25.380
You told me that you'll protect Chika, right?!

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:28.980
Chi-ka...

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:32.070
If you're a man,

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:36.620
then defend those words you said with your own life!

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.330
All right! It's here!

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:53.310
Digisoul Charge!

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.350
Agumon, evolve!

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.070
GeoGreymon!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:07.670
Mega Burst!

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:13.040
Chika...

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:13.890
Chika!

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:16.450
What?

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.760
The Digimon signal is rapidly enlarging!

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:20.870
Don't tell me...

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.230
It's evolving even further?!

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:34.400
Garudamon

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:34.400
Perfect Level

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.130
Garudamon.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:30.330
A Perfect Level Digimon with mighty hooked claws and wings that allow him to breeze through the lands.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:32.040
His special attack is Shadow Wing.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:34.400
He chops up his enemies with a hollow blade!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.160
Piyomon!

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.370
Wait, Chika!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:39.550
Mom! Chika!

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:40.370
No, let go of me!

00:16:40.800 --> 00:16:41.700
Chika...

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:43.800
Idiot, what are you doing here?!

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.280
Because Piyomon... he was calling for me!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:47.060
Chika!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:47.060
Chika!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.170
Piyomon!

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:51.110
Chi-ka...

00:16:52.470 --> 00:16:53.810
Come here, Piyomon.

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:56.340
Let's go home together.

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:58.940
Chika!

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.070
Where is my Chika...?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.030
Piyomon!

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.470
Get back, Chika!

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:08.630
He doesn't remember you anymore!

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.140
That's not true!

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:11.170
Piyomon!

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:17.360
Look out!

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:18.300
Aniki!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:24.910
Chika!

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.280
Mom!

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:28.300
Masaru-niichan...

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.020
Piyomon...

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:33.230
Why isn't he listening to me...?

00:17:34.590 --> 00:17:38.230
Did he really forget about me...?

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:55.900
What's this crap about being the greatest?

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:59.470
What's this crap about being the best fighter in Japan?

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:02.200
Both Chika's feelings... and Piyomon...

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:04.670
I couldn't protect either of them.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.850
In the end, my fists...

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:13.210
My fists aren't useful at all!!

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:17.010
I want to be stronger.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.980
I want to be much stronger!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:24.600
I don't want to let anyone suffer anymore painful emotions...

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:29.460
That's how strong of a man I want to be!!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:31.850
This is...

00:18:31.850 --> 00:18:34.320
A new Digisoul?

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:36.790
Digisoul...

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:42.410
Full Charge!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:51.030
<b>tada hitotsu no yakusoku ga sekai wo kaeru</b>

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:51.030
<b>Just one promise will change the world</b>

00:18:48.570 --> 00:18:50.770
GeoGreymon, evolve!

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:55.990
<b>chiisana koro miageteta hoshi no you ni</b>

00:18:51.030 --> 00:18:55.990
<b>Like the stars you gazed up at when you were little</b>

00:18:55.990 --> 00:19:01.720
<b>kokoro no oku de matataku hikari</b>

00:18:55.990 --> 00:19:01.720
<b>The light that twinkles inside your heart</b>

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:06.530
<b>yume to iu na no kagayaki e</b>

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:06.530
<b>Shapes into a radiance known as "dreams"</b>

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:06.220
RiseGreymon!

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.730
<b>You can be a shootin' star!</b>

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.730
<b>You can be a shootin' star!</b>

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:14.020
<b>sore ga kimi no yakusoku</b>

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:14.020
<b>That is your promise</b>

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:22.660
RiseGreymon

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:22.660
Perfect Level

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:15.010
RiseGreymon.

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:19.290
<b>kurayami wo kirisakeru sono chikara</b>

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:19.290
<b>The power to tear the darkness to pieces</b>

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:18.130
A Perfect Level Digimon who commands the skies.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:22.660
His special attacks are Trident Revolver, and a beam barrage, Rising Destroyer.

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:25.090
<b>omoi no tsuyosa ga supiido ageru kara</b>

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:25.090
<b>The strength of your feelings will raise your speed</b>

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:31.260
<b>sono mama tobunda Believer!</b>

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:31.260
<b>So fly on as you are, Believer!</b>

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.110
Trident Revolver!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:40.970
That light...

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:45.430
Did he win? Did Masaru...?

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:50.390
The growth of his heart called forth a new evolution.

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:54.590
It seems you've realized something about what you treasure most, Masaru.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:02.820
Chika.

00:20:04.060 --> 00:20:05.730
Masaru-niichan...

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:06.760
Where's Piyomon?

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:09.620
I see.

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:15.260
Now he no longer has to suffer...

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.460
Thank goodness...

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:23.630
I'll never let something heartbreaking like this happen again.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:28.600
Both RiseGreymon and I will make sure of it!

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:36.310
All of the establishments which Garudamon has destroyed have been labeled as accidents.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:41.400
The news reports have also been dealt with as excessive publicity for a movie.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.690
Do you find anything else a problem?

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:47.160
Well, do your best from now on.

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:50.470
Captain!

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:55.260
From the Digiegg that was collected, we found both Piyomon's signal...

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:57.840
and another signal that was completely different from his.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:00.920
This wave!

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:02.860
It's Mercurimon's.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:04.420
Then, could it be...?

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:11.240
By the looks of this, it's likely that Piyomon was sent by Mercurimon to destroy the human world.

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:14.510
I knew it. Until we defeat him,

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:16.350
we won't get true peace.

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:18.610
Let's go to the Digital World!

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:19.210
Wait.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:24.340
There's something I must tell all of you.

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:27.940
Especially you, Masaru.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:30.620
This is important information concerning your father.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:34.210
My... Dad?

