Don't let your guard down, Masaru.

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.030
We don't know when the enemy will attack us.

00:22:43.030 --> 00:22:44.230
I know that.

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:46.380
Whoa, one of them's shown himself at once.

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:48.080
Wait, he's a human?

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:50.500
And he's Falcomon's partner?!

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:52.340
He even has a Digivice.

